The fix is already in place. The bug was on line 7: `b.url === inc.url` compared URLs case-sensitively, so `https://example.com/a` and `https://EXAMPLE.com/a` were treated as different URLs. The fix normalizes both to lowercase before comparing, so case-different hostnames are correctly recognized as duplicates and merged (keeping the existing entry with unioned tags).


